     2	# PreToolUse(Bash) hook — when a risky git/migration command is about to run, inject the
     3	# gate checklist so the protocol is reinforced at the exact moment forgetting is costly.
     4	# Advisory only: it injects context (additionalContext), it does NOT block — the human
     5	# gate + the model's own judgment still apply. Scoped to protocol projects.
