    46	    # 16384-bit RSA key's ~10.5KB body exceeded a 10K cap and stopped redacting),
    47	    # the same class of regression as the R2 name-prefix bound. Each character is
    48	    # scanned by at most one BEGIN, so it stays linear. The "-----END" GUARD
