   134	# ---- scan()-side false-positive gate for ASSIGN_RE (2026-07-15i, operator-directed) ----
   135	# ASSIGN_RE's name family (...TOKEN/...SECRET/...PASSWORD/...KEY) also matches everyday AUTH-CODE
   136	# idioms: `autoRefreshToken: [REDACTED:secret-value] test fixtures like `access_token: '[REDACTED:secret-value]'`, code references like
